Package: gbscan
Title: Scan GenBank for Genetic Markers
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Stenio I. A.", "Foerster", , "EDIT-ME@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Counts and downloads nucleotide records for genetic markers
    and taxa from GenBank (NCBI). Downloads run in batches, can resume after
    an interruption, and can hold more than 50,000 records for one taxon
    and marker. The parsers write record and feature metadata to two
    tibbles, add taxonomic ranks from the NCBI Taxonomy database, and write
    the sequences of each marker to FASTA files. A marker dictionary is
    supplied with the package. The user can edit it to add or change
    markers.
URL: https://EDIT-ME.github.io/gbscan/
